{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15mini_level_act15mini_st04","groupId":"act15mini","stageId":null,"title":"自然的啟示","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15mini/level_act15mini_st04.txt","sourceHash":"858202393f1e4aa98d903041d6982ae242922447b347b397b4efac41c5bdc515","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g1_blackforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把呼吸器摘下來吧麥哲倫。這裡沒有孢子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚，哈啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，蘑菇好可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可早就提醒過你了麥麥，不要亂碰不要亂碰不要亂碰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不聽勸，現在吃苦頭了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的錯，我的錯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你給我的那個空盒子？我給裝好蘑菇封起來了。喏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，謝、謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒想到孢子濃度會那麼高，還、還會麻痹呼吸系統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這蘑菇是吃肉的，你猜肉是怎麼來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你們怎麼沒事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是獵人，肯定有對付它們的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是被人知道我死在蘑菇沼裡，很丟臉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）提豐，拿貢品。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）貢品......我們到地方了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深吸一口氣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——確實。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們去哪裡？等等我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼是“貢品”啊，我嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然不是，你個呆頭羽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是薩米的心臟，原初的森林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的來處與去處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準備些食物當作獻給薩米的貢品，我們就可以進去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不準備會發生壞事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰知道，萬一呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"壓縮餅乾可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"碾碎撒在地上就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）大地啊，我們將要行過您的軀體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）將這貢品敬獻給您，願我們能得到您的注視，不流血，不遭獵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）薩米允諾了，諸位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）而它將因諸位的慷慨好好吃一頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的用詞......是否有些輕浮，年輕的薩滿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，薩滿學徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟不是正式場合，不要太計較，寒檀木裔，薩米不會介意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一位薩滿，一位獵手，一個外鄉人？這組合在薩米可不常見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位來這裡，恐怕不是來體驗生活的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是急著去南方，沒時間繞路，借道原初之地而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，理解，師父也經常這樣做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這回不一樣啦，他把我一個人丟在這裡，要我體悟什麼“薩米的意志”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在這好幾天了，每天就是在這片樹林裡兜來逛去，什麼啟示和旨意都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您應該很熟悉吧，木裔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請叫我寒檀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，寒檀，你能不能告訴我，那些當老師的究竟想讓我們從這裡拿些什麼回去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不清楚，橡樹之子，我只來此瞻仰過，我的試煉並不在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣嗎？真可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後的路不太好走，我們得把握時間。出發吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你們一起走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道好幾棵適合休息的樹、幾處清澈的溪流，恰好還走過幾條安全的獸道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個“指木人”，一位，嗯......嚮導！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡沒有比我更合適的嚮導了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我和你們同行吧，寒檀，不然我會無聊到變成木頭的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，尊敬的薩滿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有你，獵手，以及我們的外鄉朋友，嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是無所謂啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來大家都同意了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就讓我們前進吧，歡迎來到原初森林！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有個問題，橡樹之子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？什麼問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼稱呼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我嗎？嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩米名字可能比較難記......我的老師父一般喜歡叫我橡杯，你們也這麼稱呼我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，能問下這個綽號是怎麼來的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為他老人家比較隨性，喝醉了偶爾會抓著我的角當酒杯倒酒喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是不是一直被什麼東西盯著......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一定是神靈吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吃肉的大傢伙，樹上有一個，西蒙娜後頭草叢裡有一個，左手邊樹背後還有一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，那還好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一路上奇怪的東西見得太多了，遇到肉食性動物反而沒那麼嚇人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要準備武器嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用管，它們還沒餓到喪失理智，不會想不開來攻擊我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與其擔心它們現在吃什麼，不如想想自己今晚——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要幫忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，已經搞定了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不遠處，一隻牙獸伏在地上，兩眼緊盯著提豐。\n一條明顯的傷口從它的臉頰一直延伸到臂彎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是有餓瘋了的傢伙啊，可惜，你選錯獵物了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，你的肉又不好吃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"牙獸似乎沒有離開的意願，它放低身形，將自己壓在陰影裡，隨時準備再次進攻。\n啪！\n突然間，牙獸面前的空氣發出一聲爆響，它受到驚嚇，一下子從陰影中跳開，隨後跑向遠方，只在地面上留下了些血跡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提豐，你剛剛是不是用手指把什麼東西彈出去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，專門趕這些大傢伙用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......一團葉子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要用葉片纏住空氣，然後不斷纏繞，直到它變成一顆葉丸就行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（記筆記）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，葉片怎麼纏住空氣呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別問了，我試著教過別人，可是沒人學會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別緊張，只是一頭不走運的角獸被咬斷了脖子。有可能是剛剛那個傢伙，也有可能是別的大傢伙開始行動了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來這位外鄉的朋友已經熟悉我們土地上發生的種種事件了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再過幾週，她就能當個完整的薩米人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，一個能夠理解薩米的外鄉人，真好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得我之前巡遊的時候，給那些從哥倫比亞來的，到處亂跑結果迷了路的旅人做過嚮導。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些男士女士看到食肉動物進食就大吼大叫說這說那的，後來我瞭解了一下，原來是他們覺得這場面太血腥，太不文明了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我也只是個粗人，不太懂文明什麼的，不過他們支付了一筆代價跑到薩米來，不就是為了看點“原始”、“野蠻”的東西嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人還想上去阻止食肉獸，結果差一點自己就被吃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看他們的穿著像是有身份地位的，可惜，衣服和人不太搭配。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的哥倫比亞語確實說得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯語）我還會些別的呢！我的嘴閒不住，見到什麼人都想聊天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"碰巧，我的師父也是個古怪的老頭，願意教我這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（磕磕絆絆的薩米語）多少會......語言......啊啊，是的，是的，確實是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，不過我這樣隨隨便便跟南方人閒聊，部族裡大多數人看到了是會不高興的，嘿嘿。上次啊，有支定期經過部族市集的烏薩斯商隊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我有多久沒回來了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（自然的吐息仍在這裡迴盪......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（安瑪還在庇佑這片林地嗎......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不太對勁。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（安瑪的影響還在......但它們已經來了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯“黑印”......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，西蒙娜姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚮導找到我們今晚的住處了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，已經找到了，就在前面那棵樹裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杯子哥說樹是空心的，足夠我們四個人在裡面休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還沒見過空心的樹呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很快就會見到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，這，能夠住五六個人吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最多能供十個人休息，是這裡最大的樹屋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提豐呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說獵手？她去採鼷獸存的木果給我們加餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們先休息，我去附近增添一些防護措施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這棵樹本身就被祝福過，樹外頭常年掛著避邪的物件，你還要多此一舉嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真是個較真的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜姐就是這樣的，要不是她願意幫忙，我早在雪地裡凍死三四次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜？唔......西蒙娜......寒檀木......我好像聽說過這個名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜姐在薩米很有名嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......不，並沒有，也許是我記錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒法在巡遊中自己體悟的那些知識，我就老是記不住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概這個名字在我腦海裡跟別的什麼人混淆了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（翻開筆記本）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杯子哥，既然你學了很多知識，我能問你些問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想問就問吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前在一棵大樹下撿到過兩塊樹皮，上面有些符號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道那些符號的意義是什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是密文，薩米用它來傳遞一些訊息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是未來，可能是過去，也有可能是一些自然本身的情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是相同的符號，依時間與人物的不同，祂真正要表達的意思也會大相徑庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能看看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......老樹的皮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“雪祀”......“喜悅”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這應該是一棵族樹傳達給侍奉它的薩滿的密文。給，還給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“雪祀”和“薩滿”，這是不一樣的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以把雪祀理解為首席薩滿或者是大薩滿，他不一定是最年長的，但一定是最有能力且有權威的，相當於是一個地方的首領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的師父就是一位雪祀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雪祀......那你以後也會成為雪祀嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不太想，當雪祀太麻煩了，又要照顧族人又要解決問題，誰愛當誰當吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......你已經當上薩滿了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也沒有，我只是個學徒，既不懂薩米想要什麼，也不知道薩米要我做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以才會被師父趕到這裡來，體悟什麼“薩米的意志”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你體悟到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"樹葉照常落，溪水照常流，哪裡都一樣，我是一點都沒覺得有什麼特別的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次等他老人家來了，我得和他好好抱怨一番。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜姐你回來啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我出去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可真是，了不得。地上的清霜也能起到這樣的作用嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了。我聽說，那位侍奉老樹的人，能夠駕馭風雪，讓它溫馴地在指尖跳舞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老樹沒有侍者，它也不需要我這樣的黜人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不想說的話，我也沒必要自討沒趣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老樹......族樹之間也有區別嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能夠在薩米稱得上老的樹，只有那一棵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它時常和“當下”與“未來”的使者一起出現，代表的是“過去”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是三位一體，超然於薩米的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過去啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的裝扮，我還以為你是個探險家呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒覺得你更像——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個詞怎麼說來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"民俗學者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我在不熟悉的地方啊，作為探險家，多學點總歸沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那如果有緣再見的話，我給你帶些薩米人的讀物吧，探險家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，在極端環境下，科考工作者的負重是有比較嚴格的要求的......唔，行李裡大概只能裝兩本《哥倫比亞百科全書》那麼重的書吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概是這麼長，這麼寬，這麼厚......然後是硬殼封面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你們哥倫比亞人的概念我搞不懂。反正，把你的行李給我，我掂量一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這幾件是捆在一起背在身上的，稍等一下哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都放在地上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——不錯。看來你背得動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩份薩米人的讀物差不多就是這麼重吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......什麼樣的讀物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傳說故事、部族歷史之類的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，一部完整的部族歷史，木板能堆滿好幾個樹屋，那個我就不帶給你啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我還以為我在獨眼巨人的洞窟裡看到的那些紙書，就是薩米人通常會讀的東西......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麥麥——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你回來啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你之前給我的照明燃燒棒，還有嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有倒是有，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛去採果子的時候用了一下，效果比空心葉丸還要好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你碰到牙獸了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大森林裡落單的人碰到想吃肉的牙獸，是很正常的事情吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，還有沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的，我還有半捆，你要多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先給我兩根吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，這是鼷獸存的果子，知道你挑剔，已經拿溪水洗過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜、橡杯，一起來吃吧。今天早點休息，我可不想出發的時候被一堆想吃肉的野獸堵住門口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚我來守夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照輪次應該是我，你前天剛值過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡比較安全，我也不會一直醒著。就當是給我個放鬆的機會吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......你要這麼說的話，那就聽你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）晚上小心，森林裡有邪魔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜姐，晚上生個營火吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"營火？絕對不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想把周圍的捕食者都引過來嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那就開盞燈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"燈和火應該沒什麼區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你害怕晚上睡不好，就帶上這個吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"捕夢網，能讓你不做成為獵物的夢，安穩度過這一晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就先睡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚安。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"正如橡杯所說的那樣，麥哲倫今晚沒有受到惡夢的困擾。\n她做了另外一個夢。\n仍是林地，仍是夜晚。\n但這次她並非獨自一人——或者說，一獸。\n她變成了大帝那樣的生物，而在她身旁——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一隻巨大的白色角獸正在他人的夢鄉中沉睡。\n祂的存在反映出一種寧靜的美麗，讓麥哲倫忍不住去撫摸祂。\n但祂的威儀與肅穆，又讓麥哲倫伸出的手停在空中。\n末了，她決定在祂身旁找片空地躺下，與祂一同進入夢鄉。\n做一個夢境中的夢。\n......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"narration","text":"夢境之夢中，一個黑影搖搖晃晃地向著眾人安睡的樹洞走去。\n在它身後，是一條污染與陰影之路。\n天上忽然下起了黑雪，那些雪花落在寒檀的冰霜上便互相消融，燒出一個缺口。\n影子帶著它的路徑向著缺口走去。\n突然，一隻角獸吸引了它的注意。\n那隻角獸輕輕一躍便消失了，而當陰影回過頭時，剛剛的缺口已佈滿了冰霜。\n它盯著冰霜，一瘸一拐地向著角獸消失的地方走去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"當麥哲倫醒來時，那隻白色角獸仍在身旁。\n但祂的冰晶獸角已經開始融化了。\n隨後是身軀，而後是林地。\n麥哲倫陷在雪裡，雪花落在了她的喙上。\n不知為何，麥哲倫突然覺得有些可惜。\n直到夢消失殆盡，她都沒能看到那隻角獸的眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天怎麼醒那麼早？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睡醒了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"或許也不全是這個原因，麥哲倫發現自己的睡袋，接近口袋的地方濕漉漉的。\n她明明記得自己在睡前拉好了口袋的拉鏈，但它現在開著，像是有什麼東西掉了出來。\n口袋裡什麼也沒缺——\n只是少了一個，來自薩米的紀念品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提豐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼一大清早就無精打采的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安瑪的愛，會消失嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老媽媽要照顧太多的人，當然不會永遠留在你身旁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給你的愛化了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這說不定是一件好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許冥冥之中，安瑪已經幫我們解決了一個大麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以的話，我還是想把它留在身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就幫你再找一個好了，不麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......那天襲擊我們的野獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經斷氣了，沒死多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是被某種大型食草動物給活活撞死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食草動物，應該是為了不被吃掉吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這隻食草動物就是等著獵獸虛弱的時候來尋仇的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是自己的同胞或是父母在自己年幼時被這頭捕獵者吃掉，所以自己長大後便來殺死它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"動物尋仇......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"獵手殺死獵物，幼獸長大後前來復仇，人類會做，動物也會做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們和它們的區別沒有你們“文明人”想像中的那麼大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起這個......獵手、薩滿，能麻煩你們兩位來一下嗎？前面有個更棘手的問題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西蒙娜，這個......這隻岩角獸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，是邪魔致傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"橡樹之子，先把那隻幼獸帶走，別讓它舔雌獸的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（模仿岩角獸的叫聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"幼獸聽到呼喚，顫顫巍巍地從母親身邊離開，跑到了橡杯身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小岩角獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（嗚咽）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它嚇壞了。沒事的，我在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕輕舔舐小岩角獸的額頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拿出照相機）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咔嚓——\n麥哲倫看了一眼照片。\n在自己眼中，岩角獸的傷口正在流淌如同油墨般漆黑而絢爛的血液。\n但在照片裡，傷口上什麼都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是邪魔直接造成的傷害。傷害它的應該是被污染的個體，某種野獸的軀殼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它不會被轉化的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"橡樹之子，能救嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這就來。麥哲倫，麻煩你照看它一會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（模仿岩角獸的叫聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"橡杯用手引著幼獸走到麥哲倫跟前，而後急忙向著受傷的岩角獸走去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你好？"},{"type":"narration","text":"麥哲倫伸出手，幼獸似乎很開心，把頭貼在麥哲倫手心不停磨蹭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿~~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低沉的叫聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岩角獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（痛苦的叫聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情況不妙......如果我們來得再早點或許還有救，現在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只能讓它解脫了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"獵手，往旁邊站點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫我擋住幼獸，別讓它看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（悠長的鳴叫聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岩角獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（含糊不清的嗚咽）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別怕，別怕，不會疼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕輕揮動法杖）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先睡去吧，在夢境裡，你仍舊能夠奔馳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"岩角獸","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你將跑過高山，你將跨過澤地♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（放下法杖，掏出匕首）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安瑪注視著你，你將在她的林地棲息♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不再痛苦，不受折磨♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你將與眾生的靈一起——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（將匕首刺入岩角獸的咽喉）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馳騁在，薩米的脊背上♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"願你安好，大地的靈魂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......（模仿雌獸的叫聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"narration","text":"幼獸聽到呼喚，急匆匆地跑到了橡杯旁邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低沉的呼號）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（高昂的嘯叫）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別害怕，你的母親會與你同在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以她的血......她的淚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（以沾血的匕首劃過雌獸眼角）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的角。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（用匕首重重劃過獸角）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停在你的......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"幼獸用蹄子輕輕踢著橡杯的膝蓋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蹄上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（用匕首在獸蹄上畫出一個印記）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，朋友，你的生命才剛剛開始。"},{"type":"narration","text":"幼獸還在橡杯身邊繞圈，它想將他當作新的依靠，新的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......也不是不可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只到料理完你母親的後事，好不好？"},{"type":"narration","text":"幼獸沒有回話，只是不停地蹭橡杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算怎麼處理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這憑我一個學徒可沒法解決啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘹亮的口哨聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去它的修行吧，這麻煩事讓師父來解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沿著這個方向一直走就能離開林地，不遠處就有澤地人的村莊，他們會好好招待你們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就和這位小朋友守在這裡，先給這具遺體止血，等著我的老師父過來。我不能冒險讓這樣的屍體成為捕獵者們的食物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"代我向樹冠賢者問好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你早就知道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請告訴他，烏薩斯的“黑印”與這件事有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯“黑印”？好，我記下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，和烏薩斯有關係，多半沒好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你帶的口糧夠嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩滿的學徒總不會在森林裡餓死吧，那也太丟人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個送給你，杯子哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，手電筒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我夜視還行，不過老頭子應該能用得到，謝謝啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啟程吧，朋友們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"橡杯","speakerId":"avg_npc_964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩米會保佑你們的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g3_swamp_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於，從樹林裡出來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，好像還有點訊號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"澤地人和你們做生意多，自然也就裝了很多你們的鐵疙瘩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有點好奇，杯子哥他們最後會怎麼對待那隻母獸的屍體呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"淨化掉受污染的血液和土地，刮掉傷口，然後就把它留在那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不應該把它下葬嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算埋了也會被食腐獸挖出來吃掉，多此一舉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人也一樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"橡杯也和你說過吧，在薩米，我們和野獸也沒什麼區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狩獵，被狩獵，活著進食，死了變食物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們所能做的，也就是為獵物準備些微不足道的仁慈。進食之前先確保獵物死透之類的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是自然規則，薩米的意志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想要改變它，那就只有一個辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成為祖靈之父薩米本身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提豐","speakerId":"avg_2012_typhon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然只是個傳說，大家都沒見過，哈哈~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥哲倫","speakerId":"avg_248_mgllan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......別逗我啦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“正在確認「黑印」狀態，「列巴羽」即將在水上人家交易。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寒檀","speakerId":"avg_341_sntlla_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g1_blackforest"},{"type":"narration","text":"又一具野獸的遺體，又一頭受害者。\n捕獵者踩著受害者的身體而過，一點都沒有要進食的意思。\n這並非為了飽腹，也不是復仇，而是純粹的殺戮。\n那是一隻角獸，被污染的角獸，腹部有一個明顯的空洞，但它還“活著”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"它的血，它的淚，它的口涎，都如油墨般漆黑。\n捕獵者晃蕩著走過獸道，尋找著新的受害者。\n就在不遠處，有個以同樣頻率搖晃的身形。\n很明顯，那應該是個人類。\n即使不靠近，都能聽到那獨特而有節奏的呼吸聲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘶......呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
